flowchart TD
    A[Read stocks.txt] --> B[Fetch 5-minute history]
    B --> C[Drop partial candle]
    C --> D[Calculate EMA 10, 20, 30 and RSI 14]
    D --> E{All six entry conditions?}
    E -- No --> F[Report HOLD]
    E -- Yes --> G[Fetch nearest-expiry option chain]
    G --> H[Select ATM CE returned by FYERS]
    H --> I[Build market order]
    I --> J{--live and typed symbol confirmation?}
    J -- No --> K[Dry-run and log payload]
    J -- Yes --> L[Validate symbol and lot size]
    L --> M[Submit order]